{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1c8054bdf903789c","name":"9000 Z004 Landspeeder","source":{"id":"source:reference-1c8054bdf903789c","title":"9000 Z004 Landspeeder","revision":20598,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:09:15Z","sha256":"baa946ebcd7ddf087f6dd4fc94c551b5157c4816d825606dd0050430a8cd0889","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20598","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=9000%20Z004%20Landspeeder&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1c8054bdf903789c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ubrikkian Industries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ubrikkian_Industries?action=edit&redlink=1"}," 9000 Z004 Landspeeder is an all-",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," adaptation of its ",{"tag":"a","children":["9000 Z001 Landspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/9000_Z001_Landspeeder?action=edit&redlink=1"}," model, which was designed for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ugors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ugors?action=edit&redlink=1"},". It has the same spherical design and small frame of the Z001 but features greater interior comfort and more powerful engines, appealing to a much larger audience. Among young joyriders and fans of speed, the model has become known simply as the \"Zeefour,\" and it sometimes appears in racing competitions that normally host only ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swoop Racers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swoop_Racers"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bikes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bikes"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Zeefour focuses on speed and stability over altitude or carrying capacity. It has a maximum ceiling of 1.5 meters off the ground and can manage speeds of up to 300 kilometers per hour with little chance of tipping. Not only is its design compact and stable, but its computer-enhanced navigational and steering systems also aid the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," in making difficult maneuvers (granting a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks by a character ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in that skill).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although the Zeefour is a major departure from traditional speeder design, it has proven successful enough to be imitated, and some scratch-modified ",{"tag":"a","children":["9000 Z001 Landspeeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/9000_Z001_Landspeeders?action=edit&redlink=1"}," have been created to match its capabilities. All official models of the Zeefour-type are civilian, but the enclosed capsule and high-powered engine lend themselves to paramilitary modifications, which typically include a layer of armor plating and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:40670bfa52c77cbd"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["9000 Z004 Landspeeder Statistics (CL 2)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +7; ",{"tag":"b","children"